<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen Bank calls for investor caution.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen Bank calls for investor caution.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shenzhen Development Bank Ltd's board of directors on Tuesday issued a statement calling for investors to be aware of market risk, after sharp rises in the price of its domestic A shares in the past two sessions.</p>
</text>
